## Biome Config After Migration

```json
{
	"linter": {
		"rules": { "preset": "none", "correctness": { "noUnusedVariables": "off" } }
	},
	"overrides": [
		{
			"includes": ["*.ts"],
			"linter": {
				"rules": {
					"correctness": {
						"noUnusedVariables": {
							"level": "warn",
							"options": {
								"ignoreRestSiblings": false,
								"ignoreUsingDeclarations": true
							}
						}
					}
				}
			}
		}
	]
}

